particularly good so or at least it wasn't useful&nbsp;
to them and so I realized there was a there was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:44.560 --> 00:07:49.680
a market for this I'm not interested in try&nbsp;
at this point in my career I'm comfortable I&nbsp;&nbsp;

