don't need to monetize it I just want to share&nbsp;
it and and if it's a value to someone seems to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:56.040 --> 00:08:02.440
be to a lot of people what I know why not get&nbsp;
it out there in the world and that's what The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:02.440 --> 00:08:07.760
Go Draft is all about the term Go Draft by the&nbsp;
way because people ask what does that mean it&nbsp;&nbsp;

